//@version=6
// ============================================================================================
// TTFM-MurAd  +  HTF Fractal / CISD PRO+ / Quarterly Theory   (merged into ONE indicator)
//   PART 1  TTFM-MurAd      : HTF candle blocks, C1-C6 model, IC-CISD, BSL/SSL, SMT, dashboard
//   PART 2  HTF + CISD + QT : key levels, session H/L, HTF FVG, CISD lines, Quarterly Theory boxes
// Overlay: the script lives in its own pane (the Quarterly Theory boxes sit at y = -6 .. 0 there, exactly as in
// the original HTF_CISD_QT). Everything that belongs on the price chart is drawn with force_overlay = true.
// [PERFORMANCE] Conservative execution optimizations only: chronological early exits in SMT/FVG scans,
// skip HTF-tag derivation when disabled, and delete invisible QT drawings when history is disabled.
// Signal conditions, state transitions, timeframe mapping, request.security expressions and alerts are preserved.
// ============================================================================================
